      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Studies conducted over recent years have definitively confirmed beta-blockers as the major treatment for heart failure. However, they are difficult to use and, to date, only carvedilol has been granted a Marketing Authorisation for this indication. The practical aspects of treatment with carvedilol in these patients are reviewed."},
